WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.650
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:08.920 --> 00:10.660
A thought flashed through my mind:

3
00:13.520 --> 00:14.500
if this went on,

4
00:15.440 --> 00:17.170
we'd both die.

5
00:59.220 --> 01:05.100
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

6
01:07.140 --> 01:13.100
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

7
01:14.140 --> 01:18.380
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

8
01:22.060 --> 01:29.620
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

9
01:29.980 --> 01:36.740
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

10
01:37.980 --> 01:44.620
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

11
01:45.820 --> 01:52.660
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

12
01:54.260 --> 02:00.780
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

13
02:05.540 --> 02:07.340
[Blossom in Darkness]

14
02:07.340 --> 02:09.340
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

15
02:09.340 --> 02:12.340
[Episode 4]

16
02:15.200 --> 02:16.860
After Xiangxue agreed to run away with me,

17
02:17.870 --> 02:19.050
she destroyed her immortal bones

18
02:20.200 --> 02:21.740
and willingly became an ordinary mortal.

19
02:22.040 --> 02:23.060
What does any of this

20
02:23.520 --> 02:24.810
have to do with Su Hexiang?

21
02:25.270 --> 02:26.970
Eerie Cavern is where Su Hexiang and I began.

22
02:28.870 --> 02:29.970
So you're saying

23
02:30.640 --> 02:31.890
the place where Xia Xiangxue is trapped

24
02:31.890 --> 02:32.580
is the Eerie Cavern?

25
02:32.920 --> 02:33.900
You said you held an umbrella

26
02:33.920 --> 02:34.900
over her all night.

27
02:35.200 --> 02:36.570
Does that mean she's still alive?

28
02:38.290 --> 02:39.130
Can't you find a way

29
02:39.130 --> 02:39.940
to pull her out?

30
02:40.480 --> 02:41.300
You're right.

31
02:42.640 --> 02:43.740
Xiangxue is still alive.

32
02:44.640 --> 02:46.240
I've tried everything over the years.

33
02:46.870 --> 02:48.690
But no matter how long a rope I use,

34
02:49.590 --> 02:50.810
it never reaches the bottom.

35
02:51.200 --> 02:51.690
That cave...

36
02:53.480 --> 02:54.530
It seems to go on forever.

37
03:14.150 --> 03:15.250
Giving up already?

38
03:19.380 --> 03:20.810
I guess you don't want

39
03:21.670 --> 03:22.650
to save her that badly after all.

40
03:26.990 --> 03:27.530
Hexiang.

41
03:28.920 --> 03:29.460
Hexiang.

42
03:30.240 --> 03:31.220
You know immortal magic, don't you?

43
03:31.430 --> 03:32.090
I'm begging you to help me!

44
03:32.240 --> 03:32.810
Please!

45
03:37.430 --> 03:38.250
It's not that I won't help.

46
03:38.760 --> 03:40.620
There's no magic in this world

47
03:41.080 --> 03:42.460
that can overcome Eerie Cavern.

48
03:44.360 --> 03:45.180
Besides,

49
03:46.360 --> 03:47.740
she's better off down there.

50
03:51.480 --> 03:52.500
No one can die in that cave.

51
03:53.670 --> 03:54.900
She'll live much longer there

52
03:55.830 --> 03:56.940
than she would as a mortal.

53
03:57.920 --> 03:58.530
So...

54
03:59.870 --> 04:01.370
You deliberately sent us down this path

55
04:02.990 --> 04:04.300
just to trap her here?

56
04:09.710 --> 04:10.220
Why?

57
04:11.040 --> 04:11.850
Why would you do that?

58
04:12.520 --> 04:13.720
She's your senior sister!

59
04:13.800 --> 04:14.410
Then why did you two

60
04:14.430 --> 04:15.540
sneak away and leave me behind?

61
04:15.600 --> 04:16.210
All these years...

62
04:16.560 --> 04:17.770
What am I to you people?

63
04:25.150 --> 04:26.010
I just told you.

64
04:26.560 --> 04:27.980
No one can die in Eerie Cavern.

65
04:29.680 --> 04:30.370
But she can't

66
04:30.390 --> 04:31.420
get out of that cave, either.

67
04:31.710 --> 04:32.620
If you want to save her,

68
04:33.590 --> 04:34.330
I can help you.

69
04:35.080 --> 04:35.940
Just not right now.

70
04:39.230 --> 04:40.130
Then how long must I wait?

71
04:43.960 --> 04:45.060
Until I'm in the mood.

72
04:50.000 --> 04:50.450
What's wrong?

73
04:51.000 --> 04:51.860
Not happy with that?

74
04:54.200 --> 04:55.680
Then poor Xiangxue

75
04:56.910 --> 04:58.300
will have to spend her life in that cave.

76
05:12.440 --> 05:13.540
But Su Hexiang still

77
05:13.560 --> 05:14.370
hasn't told you

78
05:14.390 --> 05:15.450
how to save her.

79
05:16.080 --> 05:17.340
She's just stringing you along

80
05:17.340 --> 05:17.970
to make you suffer.

81
05:18.080 --> 05:18.960
So what?

82
05:19.520 --> 05:20.450
Xiangxue was trapped

83
05:21.030 --> 05:21.570
because of me

84
05:21.590 --> 05:23.250
in that lightless cave for 20 years.

85
05:23.790 --> 05:24.890
How could I possibly

86
05:25.390 --> 05:26.210
walk away from her?

87
05:27.320 --> 05:28.860
After Su Hexiang became sect leader,

88
05:30.000 --> 05:31.810
she grew increasingly unpredictable.

89
05:32.150 --> 05:33.980
She spent her days indulging in pleasure.

90
05:34.640 --> 05:35.690
She began taking on disciples in droves.

91
05:36.200 --> 05:36.660
Her only goal

92
05:37.470 --> 05:38.810
was to drain their vital energy

93
05:39.030 --> 05:41.100
to advance her cultivation.

94
05:47.680 --> 05:48.500
Then why

95
05:49.270 --> 05:50.890
did she seal those people in jars?

96
05:51.350 --> 05:51.890
Because that way,

97
05:51.910 --> 05:52.890
she could keep them alive.

98
05:53.640 --> 05:54.450
As long as they were still breathing,

99
05:55.030 --> 05:56.060
their vital energy would recover.

100
05:56.640 --> 05:57.500
But if she keeps doing this,

101
05:58.080 --> 05:59.450
the malice will eventually consume her.

102
06:00.470 --> 06:02.180
Yet her aura remains perfectly pure.

103
06:02.760 --> 06:04.010
She draws the malice from her body,

104
06:04.270 --> 06:05.010
turns it into blood,

105
06:05.470 --> 06:06.330
and feeds it to Eerie Cavern.

106
06:06.760 --> 06:08.010
I don't know if her evil grew too strong

107
06:08.590 --> 06:10.180
or the seal on Mount Qihuang was broken.

108
06:11.120 --> 06:12.330
But after Qi Fengyin was unleashed,

109
06:12.680 --> 06:13.690
Eerie Cavern began

110
06:13.710 --> 06:14.500
releasing malice into the world.

111
06:15.350 --> 06:15.980
Even the disciples

112
06:16.000 --> 06:17.060
who came from Mount Zhaowu

113
06:17.560 --> 06:18.370
were affected.

114
06:18.560 --> 06:19.300
What exactly

115
06:19.830 --> 06:20.690
is Eerie Cavern?

116
06:22.150 --> 06:24.100
I later searched the ancient texts in secret.

117
06:25.230 --> 06:26.770
I barely found a few scattered references.

118
06:27.390 --> 06:28.620
Eerie Cavern is a creation of Heaven.

119
06:29.350 --> 06:30.330
It is neither good nor evil.

120
06:31.570 --> 06:32.580
It consumes anything

121
06:32.940 --> 06:34.130
it can absorb.

122
06:35.140 --> 06:36.830
It has always existed here.

123
06:37.090 --> 06:38.180
Once you fall into it,

124
06:38.790 --> 06:39.980
there's no way out.

125
06:41.640 --> 06:42.660
If we can find a way

126
06:42.680 --> 06:43.860
to seal Eerie Cavern temporarily

127
06:44.710 --> 06:46.050
and stop it from spreading malice

128
06:46.050 --> 06:46.830
and clouding our senses,

129
06:47.590 --> 06:49.650
we might be able to find Su Hexiang.

130
06:51.320 --> 06:52.200
Take us to Eerie Cavern.

131
07:02.080 --> 07:02.620
Sis.

132
07:02.960 --> 07:03.940
Don't call me that.

133
07:05.320 --> 07:06.420
Not even when we're alone.

134
07:08.260 --> 07:08.790
Forgive me.

135
07:09.200 --> 07:10.340
I forgot myself in the heat of the moment.

136
07:17.390 --> 07:17.970
Yinhua.

137
07:18.880 --> 07:19.590
How are you feeling?

138
07:20.520 --> 07:21.800
My brother just

139
07:21.920 --> 07:23.230
transferred some spiritual energy to me.

140
07:23.510 --> 07:24.210
I'm fine now.

141
07:24.240 --> 07:24.730
Yinhua

142
07:24.870 --> 07:26.140
still needs time to recover.

143
07:26.510 --> 07:27.660
How is Zhiwei?

144
07:28.160 --> 07:28.900
He's still unconscious.

145
07:29.920 --> 07:30.460
Yinhua,

146
07:31.600 --> 07:32.930
why did Zhiwei suddenly stab you?

147
07:34.870 --> 07:35.660
I don't know either.

148
07:36.510 --> 07:38.700
He suddenly seemed possessed.

149
07:39.160 --> 07:40.220
He kept muttering

150
07:40.430 --> 07:41.540
that he wanted to kill you

151
07:42.040 --> 07:44.580
and take your place as chief disciple.

152
07:46.920 --> 07:48.170
I was goaded.

153
07:48.190 --> 07:48.850
By whom?

154
07:49.070 --> 07:50.930
This man is nothing but trouble!

155
07:51.070 --> 07:52.140
Last night, I saw it all!

156
07:52.510 --> 07:53.250
He was using both hands

157
07:53.720 --> 07:54.900
to absorb black mist from the sky!

158
07:54.920 --> 07:55.420
Silence!

159
07:55.630 --> 07:56.400
I really have no

160
07:56.400 --> 07:57.350
improper intentions toward you.

161
07:57.480 --> 07:58.660
I just want you to take me away!

162
07:58.680 --> 07:59.820
The man I brought back...

163
08:00.040 --> 08:00.800
He's actually...

164
08:01.830 --> 08:03.580
I had nothing to do with what happened there.

165
08:04.120 --> 08:04.730
My affairs

166
08:05.750 --> 08:06.850
are none of your concern either.

167
08:08.720 --> 08:09.370
Hao.

168
08:10.040 --> 08:11.220
Have you discovered something else?

169
08:11.270 --> 08:12.140
Something is wrong on Mount Leiguan.

170
08:12.870 --> 08:13.340
Qingxing.

171
08:14.120 --> 08:15.100
Leave Yinhua in another disciple's care.

172
08:15.390 --> 08:16.900
Hurry to Luoshen Valley and bring Master here.

173
08:17.190 --> 08:17.930
It's extremely urgent.

174
08:18.160 --> 08:18.810
Don't waste a moment.

175
08:19.830 --> 08:20.460
Hao.

176
08:20.600 --> 08:21.410
Where are you going?

177
08:31.430 --> 08:32.060
Are you all right?

178
08:34.000 --> 08:34.700
Just an old ailment acting up.

179
08:35.510 --> 08:36.340
Will this really

180
08:37.120 --> 08:38.250
help us find Xiangxue?

181
08:38.840 --> 08:39.730
Of course it will.

182
08:40.630 --> 08:41.180
This

183
08:42.510 --> 08:43.340
is Eerie Cavern.

184
09:13.510 --> 09:14.850
It's the cave from my dream.

185
09:15.910 --> 09:16.420
Well?

186
09:16.630 --> 09:17.490
I'll seal it.

187
09:37.240 --> 09:37.850
I knew it was you.

188
09:38.840 --> 09:39.610
Qi Fengyin.

189
09:40.480 --> 09:42.060
I never imagined you could be so cunning,

190
09:42.750 --> 09:44.060
using such a vile trick

191
09:44.080 --> 09:44.700
to deceive me.

192
09:51.440 --> 09:53.010
You're the source of all evil in this world,

193
09:53.510 --> 09:54.420
rejected by Heaven and Earth.

194
09:55.200 --> 09:56.060
Prepare to die!

195
09:56.910 --> 09:57.700
Why is he here?

196
09:58.080 --> 09:59.490
When did he see through our plan?

197
10:01.390 --> 10:02.370
I have no time for you.

198
10:02.910 --> 10:03.820
You're not worth killing.

199
10:04.150 --> 10:05.490
Go back if you want to live.

200
10:42.600 --> 10:43.650
Fengxian, save me!

201
10:55.720 --> 10:57.580
I lied when I said I held no grudges.

202
11:08.270 --> 11:08.820
Master,

203
11:09.510 --> 11:10.610
I've finally avenged you.

204
11:34.630 --> 11:36.180
You lured His Lordship here

205
11:37.630 --> 11:39.610
just to push him into Eerie Cavern?

206
11:41.750 --> 11:42.770
He destroyed Luoshen Valley

207
11:43.270 --> 11:44.220
and gravely wounded my Master,

208
11:45.080 --> 11:45.940
then drew his sword to kill me

209
11:45.960 --> 11:46.940
and severed my arm.

210
11:48.480 --> 11:49.850
He should've known this day would come.

211
11:52.200 --> 11:53.220
She's not Su Hexiang.

212
11:54.030 --> 11:54.890
Then who is she?

213
12:09.240 --> 12:09.820
It's you?

214
12:11.200 --> 12:11.850
Master,

215
12:12.670 --> 12:14.220
could you send others to find her?

216
12:15.390 --> 12:16.010
I know

217
12:16.390 --> 12:17.580
you've never liked that girl.

218
12:24.390 --> 12:25.100
Hao!

219
12:31.240 --> 12:31.850
Hao.

220
12:32.200 --> 12:32.820
Yamao.

221
12:33.390 --> 12:34.250
You remember me?

222
12:36.000 --> 12:36.770
You were always so rebellious,

223
12:37.390 --> 12:38.650
causing endless trouble on Mount Zhaowu.

224
12:39.080 --> 12:39.730
Of course I remember.

225
12:40.000 --> 12:40.980
So that's your game, Yamao.

226
12:41.200 --> 12:42.610
You've been working with those immortal hounds!

227
12:52.960 --> 12:53.980
What is going on here?

228
12:54.870 --> 12:55.460
Why

229
12:55.670 --> 12:57.010
are you mixed up with Qi Fengyin?

230
12:57.630 --> 12:58.180
And why

231
12:58.630 --> 12:59.770
are you disguised as Su Hexiang?

232
13:00.550 --> 13:01.700
- And this demon woman... - She's not a demon!

233
13:02.720 --> 13:03.700
She's my doll.

234
13:06.480 --> 13:07.300
What exactly

235
13:08.200 --> 13:09.220
happened to you these past few days?

236
13:11.600 --> 13:12.420
It was Qi Fengyin.

237
13:13.120 --> 13:14.730
He made me look like Su Hexiang.

238
13:15.480 --> 13:16.640
I wanted to tell you

239
13:16.640 --> 13:17.250
the whole truth.

240
13:18.030 --> 13:18.580
But...

241
13:19.120 --> 13:20.000
I was afraid you'd get dragged into it

242
13:20.000 --> 13:21.130
and get killed by Qi Fengyin.

243
13:23.080 --> 13:24.420
Then I heard about Eerie Cavern.

244
13:25.270 --> 13:25.980
Once fall in,

245
13:26.270 --> 13:27.220
there's no way to climb back out.

246
13:27.670 --> 13:28.770
Only then did I dare take the risk.

247
13:29.150 --> 13:29.700
So,

248
13:30.750 --> 13:31.610
you led us to Eerie Cavern

249
13:31.960 --> 13:33.010
not to find Su Hexiang,

250
13:33.550 --> 13:34.650
but to trap Qi Fengyin?

251
13:35.030 --> 13:35.530
Of course.

252
13:36.120 --> 13:37.180
But we still need to find Su Hexiang.

253
13:38.840 --> 13:40.370
I heard some Mount Zhaowu disciples

254
13:40.510 --> 13:41.490
had been affected by Eerie Cavern.

255
13:41.790 --> 13:42.250
I figured

256
13:42.270 --> 13:43.530
you'd come here to investigate.

257
13:43.840 --> 13:45.060
With Qi Fengyin distracted by you,

258
13:45.600 --> 13:46.880
he wouldn't notice

259
13:46.880 --> 13:47.680
what I was really planning.

260
13:48.360 --> 13:49.730
What if I'd kept Qi Fengyin occupied?

261
13:50.390 --> 13:51.730
What if he hadn't come to save you in time?

262
13:52.080 --> 13:52.980
Did you think about what could've happened?

263
13:54.150 --> 13:55.490
If this cave really is so dangerous,

264
13:56.510 --> 13:56.890
how could you

265
13:56.960 --> 13:58.010
risk your life like that?

266
13:58.790 --> 13:59.250
Yamao,

267
13:59.790 --> 14:00.460
there's a limit

268
14:00.960 --> 14:01.730
to how reckless you can be.

269
14:01.870 --> 14:03.010
We're talking about Qi Fengyin.

270
14:03.480 --> 14:04.490
He's the devil

271
14:04.550 --> 14:06.010
who's terrified the immortal sects for a thousand years.

272
14:06.270 --> 14:07.370
How could I possibly stand against him?

273
14:07.960 --> 14:09.010
I only had one chance.

274
14:09.440 --> 14:10.300
I had to go all in

275
14:10.750 --> 14:11.730
to lure him into my trap.

276
14:12.390 --> 14:13.010
Besides,

277
14:14.840 --> 14:16.010
I have to save my Master.

278
14:20.630 --> 14:21.890
High Immortal Danshen is alive?

279
14:22.600 --> 14:24.060
My Master was protecting the shrine

280
14:24.630 --> 14:25.580
when he was gravely wounded and nearly died.

281
14:26.030 --> 14:27.250
He turned into this crystal.

282
14:28.150 --> 14:29.700
I was going to Mount Zhaowu for help,

283
14:30.840 --> 14:32.770
but I ran into Su Hexiang on the way

284
14:33.120 --> 14:34.420
and had to hide on Mount Qihuang.

285
14:35.320 --> 14:35.820
I'm sorry.

286
14:36.960 --> 14:38.770
I wish I'd realized all this sooner.

287
14:40.870 --> 14:41.770
But why

288
14:42.390 --> 14:43.220
did you go along

289
14:43.390 --> 14:44.850
with Qi Fengyin's act in the chamber?

290
14:47.630 --> 14:47.890
Well...

291
14:48.320 --> 14:49.340
It's a long story.

292
14:49.600 --> 14:50.890
I'll tell you everything later.

293
14:51.390 --> 14:52.650
Right now, what matters most

294
14:52.870 --> 14:53.850
is finding Su Hexiang.

295
14:56.120 --> 14:56.700
Lu Liangsheng,

296
14:57.270 --> 14:58.420
I promised to help you escape

297
14:58.600 --> 14:59.490
and save your wife.

298
14:59.870 --> 15:00.890
I intend to keep both promises.

299
15:01.360 --> 15:03.060
But could you think back

300
15:03.480 --> 15:04.300
and tell me what other secrets

301
15:05.120 --> 15:06.420
Mount Leiguan might be hiding?

302
15:07.030 --> 15:08.340
Where Su Hexiang could be hiding?

303
15:08.630 --> 15:09.460
There's a secret passage

304
15:10.000 --> 15:10.820
in her chamber

305
15:11.270 --> 15:12.060
that leads to the hill out back.

306
15:12.670 --> 15:13.850
She uses it to dispose of

307
15:14.910 --> 15:16.220
the disciples she's drained of vital energy.

308
15:18.320 --> 15:19.010
What did you say?

309
15:19.240 --> 15:20.180
Then take us there.

310
15:41.870 --> 15:42.580
Stay close to me.

311
15:51.960 --> 15:53.130
High Immortal Danshen's spirit is still intact.

312
15:53.440 --> 15:54.060
That's a good sign.

313
15:54.630 --> 15:55.610
You needn't worry too much.

314
15:56.150 --> 15:57.100
Once we return to Mount Zhaowu,

315
15:57.510 --> 15:58.580
my Master can surely save him.

316
15:58.630 --> 15:59.300
That's wonderful!

317
16:00.510 --> 16:01.490
I never imagined

318
16:01.960 --> 16:03.420
Mount Leiguan held such dark secrets.

319
16:03.910 --> 16:04.980
Only by capturing Su Hexiang

320
16:05.440 --> 16:06.940
can we put an end to this tragedy.

321
16:34.630 --> 16:35.490
Su Hexiang.

322
16:36.630 --> 16:37.770
Well done.

323
16:39.960 --> 16:41.130
You're working for Su Hexiang?

324
16:43.960 --> 16:45.180
You said you wanted to save your wife.

325
16:45.840 --> 16:46.940
Was that all a lie?

326
16:50.030 --> 16:50.610
I'm sorry.

327
16:51.080 --> 16:51.610
I'm so sorry.

328
16:51.840 --> 16:52.890
I never wanted to hurt you.

329
16:53.670 --> 16:54.490
But for Xiangxue's sake,

330
16:55.480 --> 16:56.460
I had no choice.

331
16:56.720 --> 16:58.100
I see he hasn't told you.

332
16:59.080 --> 17:00.770
I taught him how to save her long ago.

333
17:03.030 --> 17:05.250
He needs hair from a thousand men,

334
17:05.550 --> 17:06.490
soaked in spiritual energy

335
17:07.240 --> 17:08.400
and twisted into a rope.

336
17:09.200 --> 17:10.180
Then he can use it

337
17:10.790 --> 17:12.050
to pull Xiangxue out of Eerie Cavern.

338
17:12.790 --> 17:13.530
Madam, look.

339
17:13.750 --> 17:14.980
Those pills you gave me...

340
17:15.030 --> 17:16.180
I've only taken them for a few days,

341
17:16.200 --> 17:17.250
and my hair is already

342
17:17.270 --> 17:18.330
jet-black and shiny.

343
17:18.550 --> 17:20.010
There's something strange about those people in jars.

344
17:20.590 --> 17:21.380
Their bodies are withered,

345
17:21.720 --> 17:23.810
yet their hair is unusually thick.

346
17:24.110 --> 17:24.810
So

347
17:26.030 --> 17:27.460
you sealed those people in jars

348
17:28.030 --> 17:29.050
and kept them barely alive

349
17:29.480 --> 17:30.700
so their hair

350
17:30.750 --> 17:31.530
would keep growing?

351
17:32.030 --> 17:32.620
Exactly.

352
17:35.070 --> 17:35.980
All these years,

353
17:37.640 --> 17:39.380
everyone who helped me

354
17:40.350 --> 17:41.460
cultivate my powers became his reward.

355
17:42.550 --> 17:43.570
Didn't you say

356
17:44.720 --> 17:45.730
you'd help him save Xiangxue?

357
17:46.350 --> 17:47.530
Hair from a thousand men.

358
17:48.920 --> 17:49.810
Can you manage that?

359
17:57.400 --> 17:57.940
To preserve

360
17:57.960 --> 17:59.330
the spiritual energy in their hair,

361
18:00.680 --> 18:01.920
I buried them underground

362
18:01.920 --> 18:02.810
to keep them growing.

363
18:03.590 --> 18:04.330
And now,

364
18:04.920 --> 18:06.700
we've collected 999 strands.

365
18:07.510 --> 18:08.330
Just one more to go.

366
18:09.680 --> 18:11.490
Do you really think he'd let

367
18:12.030 --> 18:13.050
all that effort go to waste?

368
18:14.680 --> 18:15.330
Liangsheng,

369
18:15.880 --> 18:16.490
what do you say?

370
18:26.750 --> 18:27.490
Who would've thought

371
18:28.720 --> 18:29.730
you had it in you

372
18:30.270 --> 18:31.250
to help the immortal sects

373
18:31.720 --> 18:32.900
get rid of Qi Fengyin,

374
18:32.900 --> 18:33.620
their greatest threat?

375
18:34.310 --> 18:35.750
Looks like you, a mystical herb,

376
18:36.030 --> 18:37.190
really are something special.

377
18:37.750 --> 18:39.330
Not only can you help people ascend,

378
18:40.110 --> 18:41.490
you can do all this, too.

379
19:25.270 --> 19:25.770
Watch out!

380
19:31.640 --> 19:32.250
Hao.

381
19:42.160 --> 19:43.050
You're badly wounded.

382
19:44.240 --> 19:45.250
I'll wait right here

383
19:45.880 --> 19:47.530
and see how far you can run.

384
19:52.550 --> 19:53.380
It's a dead end.

385
19:55.920 --> 19:56.530
Hao!

386
20:08.750 --> 20:10.330
Lu Liangsheng's wife is trapped in Eerie Cavern

387
20:11.110 --> 20:12.490
because of Su Hexiang.

388
20:13.720 --> 20:14.770
I never imagined

389
20:15.350 --> 20:16.730
he'd turn against us like that.

390
20:19.590 --> 20:20.700
I was careless to trust him.

391
20:21.830 --> 20:22.380
And I put you in danger.

392
20:22.590 --> 20:23.290
It's not your fault.

393
20:24.200 --> 20:25.090
I'm just not strong enough.

394
20:30.270 --> 20:31.090
That smells wonderful.

395
20:31.350 --> 20:33.080
It's the Moonlit Revival Herb.

396
20:33.640 --> 20:34.380
Watch out for that doll.

397
20:44.920 --> 20:45.570
My ring.

398
20:46.240 --> 20:46.900
Without my ring,

399
20:47.030 --> 20:48.090
I can't suppress the energy in my blood.

400
20:50.440 --> 20:51.980
But Youyou's true form is already a doll.

401
20:53.200 --> 20:54.730
Why would my blood still attract her?

402
20:56.240 --> 20:57.700
You said Eerie Cavern spreads malice.

403
20:59.030 --> 21:00.500
The doll must've been affected.

404
21:00.500 --> 21:01.380
It's lost its senses,

405
21:01.790 --> 21:03.010
and its inner demons have taken over.

406
21:04.240 --> 21:05.580
Then I'll tie it up tighter

407
21:05.590 --> 21:06.330
so it can't cause trouble.

408
21:17.310 --> 21:18.010
Hao.

409
21:18.550 --> 21:19.050
Your wound...

410
21:19.070 --> 21:19.460
I'm fine.

411
21:20.440 --> 21:21.460
A little meditation and rest

412
21:22.000 --> 21:22.940
should help me recover.

413
21:52.200 --> 21:53.140
You're pushing yourself too hard.

414
21:53.790 --> 21:54.620
Don't you care

415
21:54.640 --> 21:55.380
if you live or die?

416
21:56.920 --> 21:57.570
Yuwen Hao,

417
21:58.240 --> 21:59.490
in recent years,

418
21:59.510 --> 22:00.250
your cultivation hasn't advanced at all.

419
22:01.270 --> 22:01.860
You no longer deserve

420
22:01.880 --> 22:02.980
to be Mount Zhaowu's chief disciple.

421
22:04.030 --> 22:05.180
Looks like you, a mystical herb,

422
22:05.720 --> 22:06.900
really are something special.

423
22:07.480 --> 22:09.140
Not only can you help people ascend,

424
22:09.880 --> 22:11.090
you can do all this, too.

425
22:26.160 --> 22:26.620
What's wrong?

426
22:31.510 --> 22:32.220
Hao?

427
22:34.240 --> 22:34.900
Yamao.

428
22:36.200 --> 22:36.980
Your wound...

429
22:54.240 --> 22:54.860
What's happening to you?

430
22:57.640 --> 22:58.380
I'm afraid

431
22:59.550 --> 23:00.700
Eerie Cavern has affected me, too.

432
23:04.350 --> 23:05.050
Hao.

433
23:05.590 --> 23:06.530
You have to fight it!

434
23:07.400 --> 23:08.290
You're the admired

435
23:08.290 --> 23:09.220
chief disciple of Mount Zhaowu,

436
23:09.440 --> 23:10.180
the pride of the immortal sects.

437
23:10.590 --> 23:11.420
You've devoted your life to fighting evil.

438
23:11.640 --> 23:12.380
You always stand for what's right.

439
23:12.720 --> 23:13.180
You'd never

440
23:13.200 --> 23:14.220
become someone like Su Hexiang...

441
23:36.480 --> 23:37.290
Think carefully.

442
23:38.110 --> 23:39.050
My Master and Mount Zhaowu

443
23:39.070 --> 23:39.810
have always been close.

444
23:40.200 --> 23:41.050
If you hurt me,

445
23:41.310 --> 23:42.180
you'll lose your spiritual mark,

446
23:42.480 --> 23:43.810
and your Master will never forgive you!

447
23:44.110 --> 23:44.860
Yuwen Hao,

448
23:45.510 --> 23:46.420
your cultivation

449
23:46.420 --> 23:47.570
has stagnated for years.

450
23:48.070 --> 23:48.660
Eat her,

451
23:49.260 --> 23:50.460
and you'll become immortal at once.

452
23:51.310 --> 23:52.080
Don't come any closer!

453
23:52.590 --> 23:53.330
I don't want to hurt you.

454
23:53.790 --> 23:54.620
Killing someone

455
23:54.640 --> 23:55.590
for your own selfish desires?

456
23:56.110 --> 23:57.460
How could you face your sect?

457
23:58.680 --> 23:59.940
She's a mystical herb

458
24:00.680 --> 24:01.420
in her true form, not a human!

459
24:32.440 --> 24:33.860
Qi... Qi Fengyin.

460
24:35.200 --> 24:36.490
How did you get out of Eerie Cavern?

461
24:38.880 --> 24:40.490
How many times have you lied to me?

462
24:43.240 --> 24:43.660
I...

463
24:45.750 --> 24:46.620
So now you're afraid?

464
24:48.750 --> 24:49.730
If you knew you'd be afraid,

465
24:50.640 --> 24:52.090
why did you do it?

466
24:57.680 --> 24:58.010
I...

467
24:59.310 --> 24:59.820
If you're going to kill me,

468
24:59.820 --> 25:00.880
please make it quick.

469
25:01.070 --> 25:02.250
Don't keep me alive just to torture me.

470
25:02.680 --> 25:03.700
I don't want to kill you.

471
25:05.000 --> 25:06.420
And I have no interest in torturing you.

472
25:07.480 --> 25:09.770
But a promise is a promise.

473
25:11.680 --> 25:13.570
Now it's time to keep yours.

474
25:16.270 --> 25:17.330
I rather like

475
25:17.350 --> 25:18.180
Su Hexiang's method.

476
25:20.680 --> 25:21.860
I'll seal you in a jar

477
25:22.000 --> 25:23.540
to nourish my flower.

478
25:29.830 --> 25:30.770
Su Hexiang, the one you're looking for,

479
25:31.030 --> 25:31.700
is right outside!

480
25:42.750 --> 25:43.490
Qi Fengyin?

481
25:48.440 --> 25:49.760
How did you escape Eerie Cavern?

482
25:50.350 --> 25:51.290
Did you see Xiangxue?

483
26:40.350 --> 26:40.730
No!

484
26:41.350 --> 26:41.730
No!

485
26:42.750 --> 26:44.050
That's the only thing that can save Xiangxue!

486
26:46.280 --> 26:46.770
Go!

487
26:48.440 --> 26:48.860
Go!

488
27:24.030 --> 27:24.570
Don't move.

489
27:35.440 --> 27:36.260
I'm hurt?

490
27:36.480 --> 27:37.570
You're dying.

491
27:38.880 --> 27:39.180
I...

492
27:39.310 --> 27:39.900
Sit still.

493
27:48.070 --> 27:49.180
Why am I so unlucky?

494
27:49.720 --> 27:51.120
I'm still young,

495
27:51.120 --> 27:52.250
beautiful, and in my prime.

496
27:52.550 --> 27:53.700
I can't die like this.

497
27:55.880 --> 27:56.620
Qi Fengyin,

498
27:57.030 --> 27:58.090
you have to save me!

499
27:59.550 --> 28:00.700
I know

500
28:00.720 --> 28:02.380
you're still angry about the Eerie Cavern.

501
28:03.880 --> 28:06.010
But that place was full of malice.

502
28:06.480 --> 28:09.290
I just lost my head for a moment.

503
28:09.510 --> 28:10.570
The cave got into my mind,

504
28:10.960 --> 28:12.420
and that's why I made

505
28:13.030 --> 28:14.140
one tiny mistake.

506
28:15.510 --> 28:17.250
You lost your head?

507
28:18.070 --> 28:19.290
The cave influenced you?

508
28:20.000 --> 28:22.090
Lu Liangsheng said the Mount Zhaowu disciples

509
28:22.350 --> 28:23.660
were affected by the cave, too.

510
28:24.110 --> 28:25.290
I think that was the moment

511
28:26.270 --> 28:27.940
you started plotting against me.

512
28:28.510 --> 28:29.140
Am I right?

513
28:31.200 --> 28:32.460
Putting that aside,

514
28:32.830 --> 28:34.220
your mystical flower is innocent.

515
28:34.750 --> 28:35.620
How can you let this little sprout

516
28:35.640 --> 28:36.460
die along with me?

517
28:36.720 --> 28:37.180
I know...

518
29:02.000 --> 29:03.010
What's happening?

519
29:03.440 --> 29:05.250
This thing is draining your blood and life force.

520
29:05.790 --> 29:06.810
Some of the hair

521
29:07.110 --> 29:08.180
has already burrowed deep into your body.

522
29:08.680 --> 29:09.700
What I'm doing now

523
29:11.030 --> 29:12.620
will only slow your death.

524
29:14.110 --> 29:14.660
What?

525
29:15.110 --> 29:15.460
I...

526
29:18.720 --> 29:19.770
It must be Su Hexiang.

527
29:20.350 --> 29:21.420
To keep this hair

528
29:21.420 --> 29:22.210
alive,

529
29:22.550 --> 29:23.940
she must've used some forbidden technique

530
29:24.270 --> 29:25.630
to make it greedily absorb

531
29:25.630 --> 29:26.490
every bit of nourishment it can find.

532
29:31.160 --> 29:31.850
It's okay.

533
29:32.240 --> 29:32.730
It's okay.

534
29:33.680 --> 29:34.330
After everything

535
29:34.350 --> 29:35.860
I've been through lately,

536
29:35.920 --> 29:36.620
there has to be a way out.

537
29:37.720 --> 29:38.460
Where's Youyou?

538
29:38.830 --> 29:39.740
Maybe she knows

539
29:39.740 --> 29:40.860
what we should do.

540
29:44.830 --> 29:46.180
She's not in her right mind.

541
29:46.750 --> 29:47.530
If we let her out,

542
29:48.240 --> 29:48.980
she'll just

543
29:48.980 --> 29:50.090
keep attacking you.

544
29:51.400 --> 29:53.530
So much for being an ancient demon.

545
29:54.030 --> 29:55.290
She's useless when it matters most.

546
30:01.200 --> 30:01.940
Qi Fengyin,

547
30:02.200 --> 30:03.460
in your original plan,

548
30:03.680 --> 30:04.380
were you going to

549
30:04.550 --> 30:05.290
kill Su Hexiang

550
30:05.310 --> 30:06.460
whether you

551
30:08.350 --> 30:09.620
got the malice or not?

552
30:15.830 --> 30:16.900
She had to die.

553
30:33.640 --> 30:34.250
You're hurt.

554
30:35.310 --> 30:35.980
Come on, let's sit down.

555
31:16.640 --> 31:16.980
Does it hurt?

556
31:22.880 --> 31:24.140
You have always been stubborn.

557
31:24.590 --> 31:25.530
You keep your feelings

558
31:25.680 --> 31:26.530
bottled up inside.

559
31:27.440 --> 31:28.490
How is anyone supposed to know?

560
31:44.510 --> 31:45.290
I never thought

561
31:46.790 --> 31:48.010
you'd actually tend to my wounds.

562
31:49.270 --> 31:50.010
I thought

563
31:50.440 --> 31:52.140
you hated me with all your heart.

564
31:52.750 --> 31:53.620
There's no need

565
31:54.160 --> 31:55.330
for those veiled insults.

566
31:57.440 --> 31:58.490
I've never forgotten

567
31:59.160 --> 32:00.420
how close we once were, like family.

568
32:02.640 --> 32:03.570
Like family?

569
32:06.790 --> 32:08.290
The three of us met at the same time.

570
32:09.070 --> 32:10.330
We were inseparable.

571
32:11.070 --> 32:12.460
Why was I only ever a family to you,

572
32:12.480 --> 32:13.620
while you and Xiangxue

573
32:13.680 --> 32:14.660
fell in love?

574
32:16.070 --> 32:16.810
It was my fault.

575
32:18.640 --> 32:19.810
I shouldn't have fallen for Xiangxue.

576
32:23.400 --> 32:24.860
Whatever punishment you have for me,

577
32:25.720 --> 32:26.460
I'll accept it.

578
32:30.790 --> 32:32.090
But please, I'm begging you. Save Xiangxue.

579
32:33.160 --> 32:33.700
20 years.

580
32:34.920 --> 32:36.090
I've spent 20 years gathering that hair.

581
32:37.440 --> 32:37.980
All that hair

582
32:38.000 --> 32:39.420
was ripped out by that man.

583
32:39.960 --> 32:40.860
Once tonight is over,

584
32:42.400 --> 32:43.620
everything I've worked for

585
32:45.110 --> 32:46.380
these past 20 years will be lost.

586
32:48.960 --> 32:49.860
And I have no idea

587
32:49.860 --> 32:50.940
when I'll ever see Xiangxue again.

588
32:56.030 --> 32:57.330
Please, I'm begging you to save her.

589
32:58.310 --> 32:58.980
I'm begging you.

590
33:02.510 --> 33:04.140
What a touching display of devotion.

591
33:06.830 --> 33:08.570
My senior sister certainly found herself a devoted man.

592
33:14.920 --> 33:15.490
Enough.

593
33:17.920 --> 33:18.770
I'm tired, too.

594
33:20.640 --> 33:21.810
I don't want to make things harder for you anymore.

595
33:31.920 --> 33:33.330
Do one thing for me,

596
33:35.440 --> 33:36.730
and you can save Xiangxue.

597
33:40.550 --> 33:41.050
Did you

598
33:41.750 --> 33:42.570
see Xia Xiangxue

599
33:42.590 --> 33:43.490
at the bottom of the cave?

600
33:45.270 --> 33:45.900
I don't know.

601
33:46.640 --> 33:47.730
How could you not know?

602
33:52.110 --> 33:53.570
I don't remember much about

603
33:54.440 --> 33:55.420
what happened inside Eerie Cavern.

604
33:56.030 --> 33:56.980
All I remember is that

605
33:58.640 --> 33:59.980
something I can't even describe

606
34:00.030 --> 34:01.140
tried to trap me.

607
34:02.240 --> 34:03.490
I tore it apart

608
34:04.440 --> 34:05.730
and escaped.

609
34:07.750 --> 34:09.300
So even a creation of divine craftsmanship

610
34:09.670 --> 34:11.170
is nothing

611
34:11.480 --> 34:12.780
against overwhelming power.

612
34:13.480 --> 34:14.460
Now that you know,

613
34:15.000 --> 34:15.740
don't ever

614
34:16.960 --> 34:18.050
try anything like that again.

615
34:21.880 --> 34:23.530
I'll behave myself. I promise.

616
34:28.550 --> 34:30.010
Y-You don't believe me?

617
34:30.230 --> 34:30.860
What do you think?

618
34:39.670 --> 34:40.860
Back in the secret passage,

619
34:41.280 --> 34:42.530
why did you suddenly stop using your powers?

620
34:43.480 --> 34:44.780
Why did you give Su Hexiang

621
34:44.800 --> 34:45.570
a chance to strike?

622
35:03.190 --> 35:03.940
Didn't you already

623
35:03.960 --> 35:04.860
have it under control?

624
35:06.280 --> 35:07.300
Since we got here,

625
35:08.800 --> 35:09.900
the Wanjun Lock

626
35:10.110 --> 35:10.980
has been growing stronger.

627
35:14.710 --> 35:15.650
I see.

628
35:16.590 --> 35:17.980
We're in the territory of the Five Great Sects.

629
35:18.840 --> 35:20.300
No wonder the Wanjun Lock

630
35:20.710 --> 35:21.780
has grown stronger.

631
35:24.360 --> 35:24.740
Oh, right.

632
35:25.360 --> 35:26.300
Where's Yuwen Hao?

633
35:26.800 --> 35:28.530
Eerie Cavern had clouded his mind,

634
35:28.880 --> 35:30.210
and my blood affected him, too.

635
35:31.630 --> 35:32.340
Enough talking.

636
35:32.800 --> 35:33.530
Give me your hand.

637
35:34.670 --> 35:35.530
My ring.

638
35:35.710 --> 35:37.090
You actually got it back for me?

639
35:41.920 --> 35:43.780
It'll mask that awful smell of yours.

640
35:47.280 --> 35:48.900
Are you saying I stink?

641
35:49.190 --> 35:50.170
Yuwen Hao

642
35:50.670 --> 35:51.570
is still locked up in there.

643
35:57.320 --> 35:58.820
You can't use your powers right now.

644
35:59.320 --> 36:00.460
If Hao were here,

645
36:00.670 --> 36:01.360
maybe we

646
36:01.360 --> 36:02.740
could take down Su Hexiang together.

647
36:02.960 --> 36:03.490
After all,

648
36:03.670 --> 36:04.820
she's still badly injured

649
36:05.110 --> 36:05.900
and barely hanging on.

650
36:06.920 --> 36:08.380
He nearly killed you.

651
36:09.800 --> 36:10.460
No matter what,

652
36:11.550 --> 36:12.980
I'm not letting you near him again.

653
36:17.150 --> 36:18.490
Then doesn't that mean

654
36:18.510 --> 36:19.210
we're completely out of options?

655
36:40.400 --> 36:41.780
That should be enough

656
36:41.780 --> 36:42.500
to scare Su Hexiang.

657
36:42.590 --> 36:43.130
Let's go.

658
36:43.150 --> 36:44.380
We're running out of time.

659
36:59.150 --> 37:00.420
She can follow

660
37:00.440 --> 37:01.420
the scent of your herbs.

661
37:03.070 --> 37:04.380
She's got my life in her hands.

662
37:05.030 --> 37:05.870
She's probably been waiting

663
37:05.870 --> 37:06.780
to make a deal with us.

664
37:20.030 --> 37:21.480
Made up her mind already?

665
37:22.630 --> 37:23.940
Just what I'd expect from

666
37:23.940 --> 37:24.900
High Immortal Danshen's disciple.

667
37:25.670 --> 37:26.530
She's pretty sharp.

668
37:35.670 --> 37:36.650
It's your choice.

669
37:38.840 --> 37:39.820
This is your last chance

670
37:39.840 --> 37:41.010
to save Xiangxue.

671
38:17.030 --> 38:18.460
You really are badly hurt.

672
38:18.840 --> 38:20.260
What a shame about that body of yours.

673
38:20.800 --> 38:21.900
It can heal almost anything,

674
38:22.510 --> 38:23.820
yet it can't save your own life.

675
38:24.030 --> 38:25.530
Still mocking me at a time like this?

676
38:25.920 --> 38:27.260
You're hardly any better off than I am.

677
38:28.710 --> 38:29.860
I have no interest in killing you.

678
38:31.030 --> 38:32.530
I just want my malice back.

679
38:32.880 --> 38:33.820
But first,

680
38:34.070 --> 38:35.090
heal her wounds.

681
38:39.190 --> 38:40.130
Who would've thought?

682
38:40.760 --> 38:41.560
The devil who strikes fear

683
38:41.560 --> 38:43.160
into the whole world

684
38:43.550 --> 38:44.610
has been completely tamed

685
38:44.610 --> 38:45.820
by a little girl.

686
38:47.440 --> 38:48.860
Such a scrawny little thing,

687
38:50.110 --> 38:51.380
yet you're quite taken with her.

688
38:52.320 --> 38:53.260
Then let's make a deal.

689
38:54.400 --> 38:55.970
Start by healing her.

690
39:59.200 --> 39:59.880
Su Hexiang!

691
39:59.880 --> 40:00.690
What are you doing?

692
40:06.670 --> 40:08.130
You're still after my herb core?

693
40:09.960 --> 40:11.340
Even if you get my herb core,

694
40:11.710 --> 40:12.690
you're still going to die.

695
40:13.150 --> 40:14.340
Why are you so determined to eat me?

696
40:14.880 --> 40:15.980
Why would I eat you?

697
40:17.230 --> 40:18.820
I'm the leader of Mount Leiguan.

698
40:19.550 --> 40:20.650
My immortal powers are already unmatched.

699
40:21.400 --> 40:22.490
What would I gain from eating you?

700
40:38.000 --> 40:38.650
Your herb core

701
40:41.110 --> 40:42.460
is meant to save Liangsheng.

702
40:42.710 --> 40:43.820
Don't you hate Lu Liangsheng

703
40:44.140 --> 40:45.100
with all your heart?

704
40:45.320 --> 40:46.260
Haven't you been tormenting him?

705
40:46.710 --> 40:47.170
Yes!

706
40:49.590 --> 40:50.170
I wish I could

707
40:50.190 --> 40:51.460
torment him for all eternity.

708
40:53.480 --> 40:54.860
But mortals are so fragile.

709
40:56.070 --> 40:57.570
In less than 20 years,

710
40:58.880 --> 41:00.460
he's already so ill he could die.

711
41:03.230 --> 41:03.900
I won't let him

712
41:03.920 --> 41:04.860
leave me like this.

713
41:07.230 --> 41:07.900
So

714
41:08.800 --> 41:09.980
you were willing to risk your life

715
41:10.480 --> 41:11.380
by entering Mount Qihuang

716
41:11.960 --> 41:13.210
just to save Lu Liangsheng?

717
41:13.760 --> 41:15.690
You'd even die for him.

718
41:16.110 --> 41:17.130
Is that really hatred?

719
41:50.440 --> 41:51.210
I'm fine.

720
41:56.320 --> 41:57.260
Your mystical flower is fine, too.

721
41:57.880 --> 41:58.940
She's already expelled the poison.

722
42:00.670 --> 42:01.940
If you love Lu Liangsheng,

723
42:02.400 --> 42:04.010
why don't you tell him how you feel?

724
42:05.150 --> 42:06.460
What good

725
42:08.630 --> 42:09.650
would that do?

726
42:13.550 --> 42:15.340
From the moment he first saw me,

727
42:17.400 --> 42:19.090
he was bound to fear me

728
42:20.510 --> 42:21.460
and despise me.

729
42:27.360 --> 42:28.530
But I only killed someone by accident

730
42:28.550 --> 42:29.690
because I was trying to save him!

731
42:30.150 --> 42:30.860
Why is that fair?

732
42:32.360 --> 42:33.210
He loves Xiangxue

733
42:34.230 --> 42:35.520
only because her hands

734
42:35.520 --> 42:36.370
have never been stained with blood.

735
42:37.110 --> 42:38.010
She's different from me.

736
42:39.880 --> 42:40.980
She's innocent.

737
42:43.760 --> 42:45.130
You lured Xiangxue into Eerie Cavern.

738
42:45.760 --> 42:46.490
Lu Liangsheng will never

739
42:46.510 --> 42:47.380
forgive you for that.

740
42:47.670 --> 42:49.300
What good is his forgiveness?

741
42:50.280 --> 42:51.900
I just want him by my side.

742
42:53.510 --> 42:54.740
Nothing else matters.

743
43:01.360 --> 43:02.420
I don't care

744
43:02.440 --> 43:03.260
about your past.

745
43:03.590 --> 43:05.170
I only want my malice back.

746
43:06.030 --> 43:06.610
Give it back.

747
43:13.070 --> 43:14.130
Why can't you retrieve the malice?

748
43:14.630 --> 43:15.530
It's still inside her.

749
43:16.360 --> 43:17.210
But it's tangled up

750
43:17.210 --> 43:18.260
in her deepest desires.

751
43:21.070 --> 43:22.260
Aren't you curious

752
43:22.590 --> 43:23.820
where Lu Liangsheng went?

753
43:28.510 --> 43:29.260
He...

754
43:32.360 --> 43:33.610
He went to save Xiangxue.

755
43:36.230 --> 43:37.900
He needs hair from a thousand men,

756
43:38.280 --> 43:39.210
twisted into a rope,

757
43:39.670 --> 43:41.300
to pull Xiangxue out of Eerie Cavern.

758
43:42.880 --> 43:43.780
He's still one man short.

759
43:44.320 --> 43:45.090
That's right.

760
43:45.920 --> 43:46.940
I told him

761
43:47.400 --> 43:49.130
he needs hair from one more dead man

762
43:50.840 --> 43:52.180
to save Xiangxue.

763
43:52.480 --> 43:53.570
Why would you do that?

764
44:00.670 --> 44:02.210
I want to force him to kill with his own hands!

765
44:03.320 --> 44:04.940
I'll drag him down into the darkness,

766
44:05.230 --> 44:05.900
just like me,

767
44:07.110 --> 44:08.340
with blood on his hands.

768
44:10.280 --> 44:11.300
Only then

769
44:12.440 --> 44:13.690
will he stop looking down on me.

770
44:15.800 --> 44:17.130
Even if he saves Xiangxue,

771
44:18.320 --> 44:19.460
he won't deserve her anymore!

772
44:21.710 --> 44:22.980
He'll be just like me.

773
44:24.760 --> 44:26.260
And he'll have no one but me!

774
44:31.510 --> 44:32.170
You're wrong.

775
44:33.510 --> 44:34.740
He won't kill anyone.

776
44:35.400 --> 44:36.860
How long have you even known him?

777
44:37.920 --> 44:39.130
What makes you so sure?

778
44:40.440 --> 44:41.300
Where did he go?

779
44:42.070 --> 44:43.380
Who did you tell him to kill?

780
44:44.590 --> 44:45.390
A man like him,

781
44:45.390 --> 44:46.860
who can barely defend himself,

782
44:48.630 --> 44:49.900
someone he could easily kill...

783
44:52.110 --> 44:53.040
Wouldn't that be the man

784
44:53.040 --> 44:54.340
you locked up in the secret passage?

785
44:56.800 --> 44:57.490
Hao.

786
45:29.400 --> 45:30.860
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

787
45:31.230 --> 45:31.570
I...

788
45:32.670 --> 45:33.570
I'm doing this for Xiangxue.

789
45:35.840 --> 45:36.610
I have no choice.

790
45:40.760 --> 45:41.530
Liangsheng!

791
45:48.670 --> 45:49.340
Help me!

792
46:01.710 --> 46:02.560
When did you take that?

793
46:02.670 --> 46:03.910
Last night, while you were unconscious,

794
46:03.910 --> 46:05.580
you told me everything, secrets and all.

795
46:05.920 --> 46:07.490
I figured having this would be worth more

796
46:07.710 --> 46:08.820
than ten thousand promises

797
46:08.840 --> 46:09.460
from you.

798
46:11.000 --> 46:11.690
Qi Fengyin!

799
46:13.320 --> 46:15.260
To stop Qi Fengyin from becoming the Devil Incarnate,

800
46:15.320 --> 46:17.480
we must cut out Yamao's herb core.

801
46:17.920 --> 46:18.900
Darling, you're awake.

802
46:40.620 --> 46:44.660
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

803
46:44.900 --> 46:48.340
♪So many longings♪

804
46:49.020 --> 46:51.100
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

805
46:51.300 --> 46:56.300
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

806
46:57.220 --> 47:01.260
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

807
47:01.500 --> 47:04.940
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

808
47:05.620 --> 47:07.700
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

809
47:07.900 --> 47:15.300
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

810
47:16.700 --> 47:20.380
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

811
47:20.620 --> 47:24.300
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

812
47:24.940 --> 47:28.500
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

813
47:28.820 --> 47:32.980
♪Still waits to come true♪

814
47:33.220 --> 47:36.900
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

815
47:37.460 --> 47:41.100
♪I'll stay by your side♪

816
47:41.580 --> 47:45.180
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

817
47:45.420 --> 47:52.740
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

818
48:06.220 --> 48:10.260
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

819
